---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { DIGUP_UI, SITE } from '../../lib/site';
---
<Layout
  title="DigUp — 下载本地多模态语义文件搜索"
  description="下载 DigUp（Mac / Windows / Linux）。本地 EmbeddingGemma 2 搜索照片、PDF、音频、视频与可选代码。"
  canonicalPath="/"
  lang="zh"
  ogImage={DIGUP_UI.hero.src}
>
  <main class="home-main">
    <section class="stage wrap-wide">
      <p class="stage-eyebrow">本地多模态搜索 · digup.run</p>
      <h1>用自然语言描述，在本机把文件「挖」出来。</h1>
      <p class="stage-lede">
        DigUp 找的是照片、PDF、文档、录音、视频里的<strong>内容</strong>——
        用 EmbeddingGemma 2 做私有文件夹索引。不是网盘，也不是启动器。
      </p>

      <div class="dl-arch" id="download" aria-label="下载 DigUp">
        <a class="dl-primary" href={SITE.downloads.mac} rel="noopener noreferrer" download>
          <span class="dl-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18.71 19.5c-.83 1.24-1.71 2.45-3.05 2.47-1.34.03-1.77-.79-3.29-.79-1.53 0-2 .77-3.27.82-1.31.05-2.3-1.32-3.14-2.53C4.25 15 2.94 10.53 4.7 7.5c.87-1.52 2.43-2.48 4.12-2.51 1.28-.02 2.5.87 3.29.87.78 0 2.26-1.07 3.81-.91.65.03 2.47.26 3.64 1.98-.09.06-2.17 1.28-2.15 3.81.03 3.02 2.65 4.03 2.68 4.04-.03.07-.42 1.44-1.38 2.83M13 3.5c.73-.83 1.22-2 1.08-3.15-1.05.04-2.31.72-3.05 1.58-.66.76-1.23 1.98-1.08 3.14 1.14.09 2.32-.65 3.05-1.57"/></svg></span>
          <span class="dl-copy">
            <strong>下载 DigUp（Mac）</strong>
            <span>Apple Silicon · macOS 14+ · DMG · <em class="ver">{SITE.downloads.macVersion}</em></span>
          </span>
        </a>
        <div class="dl-secondary">
          <a class="dl-pill" href={SITE.downloads.windows} rel="noopener noreferrer" download>
            <span class="os-ico" aria-hidden="true">▦</span>
            Windows <em>测试</em>
            <span class="ver-chip">{SITE.downloads.windowsVersion}</span>
          </a>
          <a class="dl-pill" href={SITE.downloads.linuxDeb} rel="noopener noreferrer" download>
            <span class="os-ico" aria-hidden="true">⬡</span>
            Linux .deb
            <span class="ver-chip">{SITE.downloads.linuxVersion}</span>
          </a>
          <a class="dl-pill" href={SITE.downloads.linuxAppImage} rel="noopener noreferrer" download>
            <span class="os-ico" aria-hidden="true">⬡</span>
            Linux AppImage
            <span class="ver-chip">{SITE.downloads.linuxVersion}</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="stage-note">
        指南：<a href="/zh/install-mac/">Mac</a> · <a href="/zh/install-windows/">Windows</a> · <a href="/zh/install-linux/">Linux</a>
      </p>

      <figure class="app-window demo-stage">
        <div class="app-chrome" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="app-dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
          <div class="app-chrome-title">DigUp · 演示</div>
        </div>
        <div class="demo-media">
          <video
            class="demo-video"
            width="1200"
            height="800"
            poster={DIGUP_UI.demo.poster}
            autoplay
            muted
            loop
            playsinline
            preload="metadata"
            aria-label={DIGUP_UI.demo.altZh}
          >
            <source src={DIGUP_UI.demo.webm} type="video/webm" />
            <source src={DIGUP_UI.demo.mp4} type="video/mp4" />
            <img src={DIGUP_UI.demo.gif} width="1200" height="800" alt={DIGUP_UI.demo.altZh} />
          </video>
        </div>
      </figure>

      <!-- Real demo -->
      <section class="real-demo" aria-labelledby="real-demo-heading">
        <div class="real-demo-head">
          <p class="kicker">真实演示</p>
          <h2 id="real-demo-heading">DigUp 实际使用</h2>
          <p class="muted">用自然语言搜视频、音频、PDF 与代码。</p>
        </div>
        <figure class="app-window real-demo-stage">
          <div class="app-chrome" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="app-dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
            <div class="app-chrome-title">DigUp · 真实演示</div>
          </div>
          <div class="demo-media">
            <video
              class="demo-video"
              controls
              playsinline
              preload="metadata"
              poster="/media/xiaohu-digup-demo-poster.jpg"
              width="1000"
              height="720"
            >
              <source src="/media/xiaohu-digup-demo.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
            </video>
          </div>
        </figure>
      </section>

      <div class="proof-split">
        <figure class="proof-shot">
          <span class="film-label">Windows · 搜索界面</span>
          <img
            src={DIGUP_UI.multimodal.src}
            width="1200"
            height="800"
            alt={DIGUP_UI.multimodal.altZh}
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
        </figure>
        <div class="proof-copy">
          <p class="kicker">产品证明</p>
          <h2>按内容搜索——按类型分组</h2>
          <p class="muted">
            Windows 搜索面板左侧按模态列出结果
            （<strong>VIDEO</strong> · <strong>IMAGES</strong> · <strong>AUDIO</strong> · <strong>DOCUMENTS</strong>），
            右侧预览命中处——例如 “Matches the frame at 0:12”。
          </p>
          <ul class="proof-types" aria-label="结果类型">
            <li><span class="t video">VIDEO</span> 打开到那一时刻</li>
            <li><span class="t image">IMAGES</span> 匹配画面内容</li>
            <li><span class="t audio">AUDIO</span> 跳到那一分钟</li>
            <li><span class="t docs">DOCUMENTS</span> 打开到对应页</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="trust-rail" role="list">
        <div class="trust-item" role="listitem">
          <strong>本地优先</strong>
          <span>只索引你选的文件夹，不做云端文件索引。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="trust-item" role="listitem">
          <strong>打开到位置</strong>
          <span>直达页码、时间戳或代码行——不只是文件本身。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="trust-item" role="listitem">
          <strong>开源</strong>
          <span>MIT 许可的本机文件夹搜索应用。</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="band">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="band-head">
          <p class="kicker">使用感受</p>
          <h2>说出你记得的内容，落到文件里的位置。</h2>
          <p>每次都一样：用自然语言搜内容，然后打开到匹配处。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bento">
          <article class="bento-feat">
            <span class="mod-pill text">PDF / 文档</span>
            <p class="query">the clause about pets in the lease</p>
            <p class="outcome">长 PDF 中的含义匹配 → 打开到对应<strong>页</strong>。</p>
          </article>
          <article class="bento-side">
            <span class="mod-pill video">视频</span>
            <p class="query">zebra in a video</p>
            <p class="outcome">画面帧 + 音轨 → 到那一<strong>时刻</strong>。</p>
          </article>
          <article class="bento-side">
            <span class="mod-pill audio">音频</span>
            <p class="query">where they talk about sleep</p>
            <p class="outcome">约 30 秒语义窗 → 到那一<strong>分钟</strong>。</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="band">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="band-head">
          <p class="kicker">界面</p>
          <h2>搜索 → 结果 → 打开到页 / 时刻</h2>
          <p>Mac / Windows / Linux 搜索界面。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="filmstrip">
          <figure class="film-main">
            <span class="film-label">Windows · PDF</span>
            <img src={DIGUP_UI.pdf.src} width="1200" height="800" alt={DIGUP_UI.pdf.altZh} loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          </figure>
          <div class="film-side">
            <figure>
              <span class="film-label">Mac · 音频</span>
              <img src={DIGUP_UI.audio.src} width="1200" height="800" alt={DIGUP_UI.audio.altZh} loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
            </figure>
            <figure>
              <span class="film-label">Linux · 代码</span>
              <img src={DIGUP_UI.code.src} width="1200" height="800" alt={DIGUP_UI.code.altZh} loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
            </figure>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="band">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="band-head">
          <p class="kicker">模态</p>
          <h2>搜内容，不只是文件名</h2>
          <p>图片、PDF、音频、视频、可选代码——全部本地。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mod-strip" aria-label="支持的模态">
          <span class="mod-chip image"><span class="ico" aria-hidden="true">▣</span> 图片</span>
          <span class="mod-chip text"><span class="ico" aria-hidden="true">¶</span> PDF / 文档</span>
          <span class="mod-chip audio"><span class="ico" aria-hidden="true">♫</span> 音频</span>
          <span class="mod-chip video"><span class="ico" aria-hidden="true">▶</span> 视频</span>
          <span class="mod-chip code"><span class="ico" aria-hidden="true">&lbrace;&rbrace;</span> 代码</span>
          <span class="mod-chip local"><span class="ico" aria-hidden="true">⌂</span> 本地</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="band">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="band-head">
          <p class="kicker">指南</p>
          <h2>安装与了解 DigUp</h2>
          <p>安装说明与 digup 关键词指南。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="guide-list">
          <a class="guide-link" href="/zh/install-mac/">
            <span class="gl-meta"><span class="gl-tag">Mac</span><span class="gl-title">在 Mac 上安装</span></span>
            <span class="gl-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
          <a class="guide-link" href="/zh/install-windows/">
            <span class="gl-meta"><span class="gl-tag">Windows</span><span class="gl-title">在 Windows 上安装</span></span>
            <span class="gl-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
          <a class="guide-link" href="/zh/install-linux/">
            <span class="gl-meta"><span class="gl-tag">Linux</span><span class="gl-title">在 Linux 上安装</span></span>
            <span class="gl-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
          <a class="guide-link" href="/zh/what-is-digup/">
            <span class="gl-meta"><span class="gl-tag">概述</span><span class="gl-title">DigUp 是什么？</span></span>
            <span class="gl-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
          <a class="guide-link" href="/zh/vs-spotlight/">
            <span class="gl-meta"><span class="gl-tag">对比</span><span class="gl-title">对比 Spotlight</span></span>
            <span class="gl-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
          <a class="guide-link" href="/zh/embeddinggemma-2/">
            <span class="gl-meta"><span class="gl-tag">模型</span><span class="gl-title">EmbeddingGemma 2</span></span>
            <span class="gl-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
          <a class="guide-link" href="/zh/faq/">
            <span class="gl-meta"><span class="gl-tag">支持</span><span class="gl-title">常见问题</span></span>
            <span class="gl-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
          <a class="guide-link" href="/">
            <span class="gl-meta"><span class="gl-tag">EN</span><span class="gl-title">English home</span></span>
            <span class="gl-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="bottom-cta">
          <p><strong>开始挖掘？</strong>按平台下载 DigUp。</p>
          <div class="actions">
            <a class="cta" href={SITE.downloads.mac} rel="noopener noreferrer" download>Mac DMG</a>
            <a class="cta-secondary" href={SITE.downloads.windows} rel="noopener noreferrer" download>Windows</a>
            <a class="cta-secondary" href={SITE.upstreamRepo} rel="noopener noreferrer">ARahim3/DigUp</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
